            <note corresp="#d11-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d11-f1-content">
                <p>Copies to the Secretaries of the Treasury and of Commerce, the Attorney General,
                    the Acting Director of Defense Mobilization, the Federal Civil Defense
                    Administrator, the Director of the Bureau of the Budget, and the Chairman of the
                    Council of Economic Advisers.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d11-f2" n="2" xml:id="d11-f2-content">
